/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/03/01/aci-worldwide-aciw-q4-2018-earnings-conference-cal.aspx"},{"c":"ACIW 2019 Q1","e":"aciw","d":"2019-05-09","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Philip G. Heasley","x":"…recurring services that are now an integral part of the typical consumers daily experience, from streaming media and digital marketplace, the subscription based home delivery, providing a real-time, frictionless and secure digital payment experience is critical to vendors that want to capitalize","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/09/aci-worldwide-inc-aciw-q1-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"ACIW 2019 Q2","e":"aciw","d":"2019-08-08","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Philip Heasley","x":"We are on track financially for the year and we're reiterating our guidance for 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/09/aci-worldwide-inc-aciw-q2-2019-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"ACIW 2019 Q3","e":"aciw","d":"2019-11-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Scott Behrens","x":"So our expectation was, when we came out of 2018 that these [Indecipherable] and we actually increased our EBITDA guidance at the beginning of this year in reflection of these deals carrying over from 2018, but we didn't increase the guidance, they've been contemplated in our full year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/07/aci-worldwide-inc-aciw-q3-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"ACIW 2019 Q3","e":"aciw","d":"2019-11-07","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Mark Palmer","x":"At the same time, the company did not raise guidance -- financial guidance for fiscal '19 or fiscal '20.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/07/aci-worldwide-inc-aciw-q3-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"ACIW 2019 Q4","e":"aciw","d":"2020-02-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott Behrens","x":"This guidance excludes between $5 million and $10 million of continued integration-related expenses from Speedpay and approximately $10 million of onetime charges to implement the cost reduction initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/27/aci-worldwide-inc-aciw-q4-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"ACIW 2020 Q2","e":"aciw","d":"2020-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Odilon Almeida","x":"In addition, as part of our new strategy work, we're identifying additional cash cost savings by flattening our organizational structure, eliminating duplicative costs across our new organization and reducing our global facilities footprint.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/06/aci-worldwide-inc-aciw-q2-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"ACIW 2020 Q2","e":"aciw","d":"2020-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott Behrens","x":"Further, as a part of our new strategy work, the team here is identifying additional cash cost savings by flattening our organizational structure, eliminating duplicative costs across our new organization and reducing our global facilities footprint.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/06/aci-worldwide-inc-aciw-q2-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"ACIW 2020 Q3","e":"aciw","d":"2020-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott Behrens","x":"It's -- obviously, as you recall, we implemented early in the year, $20 million of structural cost reduction in the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/05/aci-worldwide-inc-aciw-q3-2020-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"ACIW 2020 Q3","e":"aciw","d":"2020-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott Behrens","x":"And then in reaction to COVID back, call it, late March, very early April, we quickly implemented another $30 million of cost savings that is continuing to benefit us.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/05/aci-worldwide-inc-aciw-q3-2020-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"ACIW 2020 Q4","e":"aciw","d":"2021-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott Behrens","x":"This excludes one-time cost related to cost reduction initiatives we discussed at our Analyst Day in November.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/25/aci-worldwide-inc-aciw-q4-2020-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"ACIW 2020 Q4","e":"aciw","d":"2021-02-25","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Odilon Almeida","x":"We are also pleased to be reaffirming the outlook we provided previously, including the Rule of 40 for the first time ever in 2021.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/25/aci-worldwide-inc-aciw-q4-2020-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"ACIW 2021 Q1","e":"aciw","d":"2021-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott Behrens","x":"Our net adjusted EBITDA margin increased to 23% in the quarter, compared to 19% in Q1 2020, as you see the year-over-year benefits of our cost reduction initiatives, as we continue to focus on profitability and drive toward achieving the Rule of 40.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/aci-worldwide-inc-aciw-q1-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"ACIW 2021 Q1","e":"aciw","d":"2021-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott Behrens","x":"Really a lot of the work we did last year in terms of, restructuring the cost base, really sets us up well as we exit the pandemic, and we can layer on that incremental revenue on top of that cost base.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/aci-worldwide-inc-aciw-q1-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"ACIW 2021 Q1","e":"aciw","d":"2021-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Odilon Almeida","x":"For the full year, we're reaffirming our guidance and as previously discussed, we expect to reach the Rule of 40 this year, for the first time ever.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/aci-worldwide-inc-aciw-q1-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"ACIW 2021 Q2","e":"aciw","d":"2021-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott W. Behrens","x":"I think a lot of the other areas, we, as a part of the cost exercise we did last year, those are areas where we where we took cost out and we reinvested pretty heavily in the selling and marketing area.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/05/aci-worldwide-inc-aciw-q2-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"ACIW 2021 Q3","e":"aciw","d":"2021-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Odilon Almeida","x":"That work was all about rethinking how we approach our business, streamlining our structure, sharpening our go-to-market strategy and getting us ready to take the next steps in our evolution.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/aci-worldwide-inc-aciw-q3-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"ACIW 2021 Q3","e":"aciw","d":"2021-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Odilon Almeida","x":"By year-end 2020, we implemented a new and optimized organizational structure to streamline internal processes, making the company leaner and more efficient.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/aci-worldwide-inc-aciw-q3-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"ACIW 2021 Q3","e":"aciw","d":"2021-11-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Odilon Almeida","x":"As a result, we are raising our 2021 guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/aci-worldwide-inc-aciw-q3-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"ACIW 2021 Q3","e":"aciw","d":"2021-11-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Scott Behrens","x":"I first plan to go through our financial results for Q3 and then provide some additional commentary regarding our increased outlook for the rest of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/aci-worldwide-inc-aciw-q3-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"ACIW 2026 Q1","e":"aciw","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Thomas Warsop","x":"In addition, as I discussed last quarter, we're investing in our AI-first road map.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/01/aci-worldwide-aciw-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ACIW 2026 Q1","e":"aciw","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Leibrock","x":"We also took certain onetime cost reduction actions in G&A during the quarter, which are excluded from our adjusted EBITDA.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/01/aci-worldwide-aciw-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ACIW 2026 Q3","e":"aciw","d":"2026-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"George Sutton","x":"But just curious if you have seen the presence of that and sort of providing that road map, have any impact on your ability to push price increases on renewals?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/aci-worldwide-aciw-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACIW 2026 Q3","e":"aciw","d":"2026-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas Woodrow Warsop","x":"Restructuring its go to market approach around the vertical specialists that we have on our sales and account management team.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/aci-worldwide-aciw-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[35,1,2914,0,0,0,2399,282],[36,1,5841,0,0,0,4774,729],[37,1,4718,0,0,0,3711,703],[38,1,5711,0,0,0,4743,692],[39,1,5754,0,0,0,4856,584],[40,1,5692,0,0,0,4782,674],[41,1,2696,0,0,0,2335,180],[42,1,5704,0,0,0,4859,515],[43,1,4246,0,0,0,3831,133],[44,1,3430,0,0,0,2702,535],[45,1,3419,0,0,0,3068,130],[46,1,4894,0,0,0,4017,625],[47,1,4415,0,0,0,3869,311],[65,1,6548,0,0,0,6082,332],[67,1,6680,0,0,0,5680,580]],"cinema":[[35,1,2914,0,0,0,2399,282],[36,1,5841,0,0,0,4774,729],[37,1,4718,0,0,0,3711,703],[38,1,5711,0,0,0,4743,692],[39,1,5754,0,0,0,4856,584],[40,1,5692,0,0,0,4782,674],[41,1,2696,0,0,0,2335,180],[42,1,5704,0,0,0,4859,515],[43,1,4246,0,0,0,3831,133],[44,1,3430,0,0,0,2702,535],[45,1,3419,0,0,0,3068,130],[46,1,4894,0,0,0,4017,625],[47,1,4415,0,0,0,3869,311],[65